Create EMP2 table again from EMP table without copying data.
(Create using Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> CREATE TABLE EMP2
     AS
     SELECT *
     FROM EMP
     WHERE 1=2;

Output:
-------

Table created.


Verify Structure:
-----------------

sql> DESC EMP2;

Output:
-------

Name       Null?    Type
---------- -------- ----------------
EMPNO      NOT NULL NUMBER(4)
ENAME               VARCHAR2(10)
JOB                 VARCHAR2(9)
MGR                 NUMBER(4)
